at very statement so if they don't  move cop is in jeopardy  just about all the g20 17 out of the 20  have said that they're going to um go to  net zero by the middle of the century  that is a move but of course that's  that's not enough what keeps me up at  night is uh just yeah thinking about the  complexity of this what we want is for  us to win for the world to collectively  win so that we can say to you know our  generation but also the future  generations that we delivered when it  mattered  that's the ambition  geopolitics may get in the way  in a few days time we'll find out  hannah thomas peter sky news in downing  street

